    <string name="home_permission_owned_by">Apps look Shizuku up by its permission, and Android says %1$s declares it - a copy of Shizuku, or what is left of one. Those apps will ask that one until it is uninstalled and the device is rebooted.</string>
    <string name="home_permission_not_registered">Apps look Shizuku up by its permission, and Android has not registered it yet, which a reinstall can leave behind until the device is rebooted. Shizuku itself is unaffected; other apps may not find it.</string>
